#!/bin/sh
# Minimal PID 1 for guest images that have no init system. build-rootfs.sh
# installs it as /sbin/differently-init and links /sbin/init to it when the
# image has no /sbin/init of its own.
#
# It mounts the virtual filesystems, brings up loopback, keeps the guest
# agent (differently-guest, vsock port 10000) running, and reaps orphaned
# processes. Zombie reaping relies on the shell's `wait` collecting any child,
# which dash, bash and busybox sh do; this is best-effort, so prefer an image
# with systemd or tini for workloads that fork heavily.
export PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin

[ -c /dev/console ] && exec </dev/console >/dev/console 2>&1

mountpoint -q /proc 2>/dev/null || mount -t proc proc /proc
mountpoint -q /sys 2>/dev/null || mount -t sysfs sysfs /sys
mountpoint -q /dev 2>/dev/null || mount -t devtmpfs devtmpfs /dev
mkdir -p /dev/pts /dev/shm /run /tmp
mountpoint -q /dev/pts 2>/dev/null || mount -t devpts -o gid=5,mode=620,ptmxmode=666 devpts /dev/pts
mountpoint -q /dev/shm 2>/dev/null || mount -t tmpfs -o mode=1777,nosuid,nodev tmpfs /dev/shm
mountpoint -q /run 2>/dev/null || mount -t tmpfs -o mode=0755,nosuid,nodev tmpfs /run
mountpoint -q /tmp 2>/dev/null || mount -t tmpfs -o mode=1777,nosuid,nodev tmpfs /tmp
[ -e /sys/fs/cgroup ] && { mountpoint -q /sys/fs/cgroup 2>/dev/null || mount -t cgroup2 cgroup2 /sys/fs/cgroup 2>/dev/null; }
mount -o remount,rw / 2>/dev/null

[ -s /etc/hostname ] && hostname "$(cat /etc/hostname)" 2>/dev/null
if command -v ip >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  ip link set lo up
elif command -v ifconfig >/dev/null 2>&1; then
  ifconfig lo 127.0.0.1 up
fi

# Optional arguments for the guest agent.
DIFFERENTLY_GUEST_ARGS=""
# shellcheck disable=SC1091
[ -r /etc/default/differently-guest ] && . /etc/default/differently-guest

# Ctrl-Alt-Del (SIGINT) or SIGTERM: flush and reboot, which ends the microVM.
shutdown() {
  sync
  umount -a -r 2>/dev/null
  echo b > /proc/sysrq-trigger 2>/dev/null
  exit 0
}
trap shutdown INT TERM PWR

(
  while :; do
    # shellcheck disable=SC2086
    /usr/local/bin/differently-guest $DIFFERENTLY_GUEST_ARGS
    echo "differently-init: differently-guest exited with status $?; restarting in 1s"
    sleep 1
  done
) &

while :; do
  wait
done
